{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫電視今日舉辦《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》紅地氈環節，全台女藝員傾巢而出以極致性感晚裝爭妍鬥麗！ 鄧凱文低胸出 …</p><p></p>\n<p>無綫電視今日舉辦《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》紅地氈環節，全台女藝員傾巢而出以極致性感晚裝爭妍鬥麗！</p>\n<h2>鄧凱文低胸出席俯身搶鏡</h2>\n<p>今日紅地氈傳媒拍攝區域星光熠熠，身穿淺色閃亮超低胸吊帶晚裝配搭紅色寶石頸飾的鄧凱文成為全場焦點。當她走到採訪區時，突然大幅度烏低身向前傾，極深V領剪裁令豐滿上圍線條表露無遺。當時她身旁正站著手持咪牌主持人梁麗翹以及應屆港姐季軍李澤欣，三人同框畫面帶來極具視覺衝擊力震撼效果。</p>\n<h2>鄧凱文單手護胸力壓陳自瑤高海寧同場比拼</h2>\n<p>面對突如其來險些走光危機，鄧凱文在鏡頭前展露笑容同時，迅速以單手輕壓胸前位置化解尷尬場面。除了鄧凱文成功突圍，同場多位女星亦以性感戰衣迎戰，陳自瑤大膽以蝴蝶結遮胸設計亮相，而高海寧則選擇正面封胸並以大露背造型反擊。林夏薇巧妙運用胸前隱約透膚配合大露背設計，各自展現出應對台慶大騷專業時尚態度。</p>\n<h2>鍾翠詩劉穎鏇陳煒梁敏巧晚裝造型各有千秋</h2>\n<p>回顧歷年台慶紅地氈大戰，女藝人服裝選擇往往反映出個人風格定位。今年鍾翠詩換上一襲香檳粉色低胸閃鑽晚裝，單側綴上立體薄紗花飾散發甜美性感氣息。擁有修長身段劉穎鏇大曬標誌性美腿，陳煒以一貫高貴性感晚裝展現成熟身段，而梁敏巧則以豐滿肉感身段成為另一攝影焦點。</p>\n<h2>郭珮文葉蒨文出招搶盡紅地氈風頭</h2>\n<p>傍晚時分舉行的紅地氈環節星光熠熠，郭珮文身穿一件黑色露肩長裙登場，其寬闊反領配合胸前V形剪裁大方展現鎖骨及豐滿上圍。同場另一焦點葉蒨文則選擇以獨特剪裁突圍而出，她穿上閃石高領連接兩幅白色布料禮服，胸前特意留下一道修長水滴形鏤空設計。兩人將視覺焦點完全集中在上半身，成為59周年台慶夜其中一個熱門話題。</p>\n<h2>梁超怡陳星妤同場火辣反擊不甘示弱</h2>\n<p>面對兩位話題女王強勢出擊，同屬《女神配對計劃》陣容其他藝人亦毫不留手。梁超怡與陳星妤在紅地氈上同樣大方展現傲人身材，兩人均以極具視覺張力晚裝示人，令現場氣氛推至高峰。現場不少工作人員及攝影師更直言「今年各位女星準備非常充足」，各人在鎂光燈下展現出專業態度，將精心準備造型呈現給全港觀眾。</p>\n<h2>各位女星造型各有千秋獲網民讚賞</h2>\n<p>一眾女星的紅地氈造型各具特色，網民紛紛留言大讚鄧凱文「條裙閃得嚟唔會太誇張，襯條寶石頸鏈好貴氣」，亦欣賞陳自瑤的蝴蝶結設計「性感得嚟又有時裝感」。高海寧與林夏薇的露背造型同樣吸睛，有人形容高海寧「正面端莊，轉身先有驚喜」，又讚林夏薇「性感同優雅平衡得啱啱好」。鍾翠詩則憑香檳粉色閃鑽裙收穫「好似小公主」的甜美評語，劉穎鏇獲讚「行紅地氈好似行天橋咁」，陳煒的成熟魅力亦令人留言表示「着晚裝一向有保證，大方又有氣場」！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508943685728522_13484189296afee41d36bb3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄧凱文 萬千星輝賀台慶2026 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508943685728522_13484189296afee41d36bb3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508943819331305_14942393976afee41e909f0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄧凱文 萬千星輝賀台慶2026 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508943819331305_14942393976afee41e909f0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508943879132567_18705205826afee41f3f4b4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄧凱文 萬千星輝賀台慶2026 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508943879132567_18705205826afee41f3f4b4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508943969832067_19779329616afee4201ed9a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄧凱文 萬千星輝賀台慶2026 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508943969832067_19779329616afee4201ed9a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508944066380095_15271910016afee4213c4ea.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄧凱文 萬千星輝賀台慶2026 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508944066380095_15271910016afee4213c4ea.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508944144533909_2275263996afee4220eccd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄧凱文 萬千星輝賀台慶2026 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508944144533909_2275263996afee4220eccd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17950894425181543_10347381126afee422ecb24.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄧凱文 萬千星輝賀台慶2026 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17950894425181543_10347381126afee422ecb24.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508539719974220_16002997146afed4558c738.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄧凱文 萬千星輝賀台慶2026 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508539719974220_16002997146afed4558c738.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508539602719447_11752157386afed454753b1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄧凱文 萬千星輝賀台慶2026 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508539602719447_11752157386afed454753b1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508944341483609_656996966afee42436776.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄧凱文 萬千星輝賀台慶2026 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508944341483609_656996966afee42436776.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%b4%85%e5%9c%b0%e6%b0%88/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">紅地氈</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%90%ac%e5%8d%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bc%9d%e8%b3%80%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b62026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬千星輝賀台慶2026</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%84%a7%e5%87%b1%e6%96%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄧凱文</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3546102\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 19 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:58:12.660925+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1559,"images":10,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:57:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T15:12:46.461794+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:51:38.815219+00:00","content_hash":"80c3b402dfc184b90f4022586d1118f1f3b5f3ce1349f5a067bf73fcd68960f1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}